  'Three hundred li northeast is Mount Min. Jiang water rises here and flows northeast into the sea, with fine turtles and Tuo. Gold and jade occur above, white min below, and mei and tang trees; xi beasts, elephants, Kui cattle, Han and Bi birds are listed.',
